    {
      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The bladder lining reacts",
        "to what ends up in urine",
        "",
        "Certain foods and drinks",
        "make that irritation",
        "and burning worse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Caffeine",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Coffee and other caffeinated",
        "drinks stimulate the bladder",
        "and increase urine output",
        "",
        "That means more trips",
        "to the bathroom, more often"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Caffeine — the fix",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap coffee for water",
        "or herbal tea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Spicy Food",
      "char_file": "고추_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Capsaicin in chili and",
        "spicy dishes gets excreted",
        "in urine",
        "",
        "It irritates the bladder",
        "lining directly, making",
        "burning and urgency worse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Spicy Food — the fix",
      "char_file": "고추_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try a mild broth",
        "or soup instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soda",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Soda's sugar feeds bacteria",
        "while the carbonation",
        "irritates the bladder",
        "",
        "That combination can make",
        "symptoms last longer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Soda — the fix",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try plain water or",
        "herbal tea instead"
      ]
    }
  ],
